accTitle: Review artifact architecture
accDescr: An agent prepares an artifact. Orca hosts its published copy for desktop or iPad. Feedback is copied back manually.
Agent[Agent] -->|prepare| Local[Local review file]
Local -->|publish when signed in| Orca[Orca artifact]
Orca --> Desktop[Desktop browser]
Orca --> iPad[iPad browser]
Desktop -->|copy feedback| Human[Reviewer]
iPad -->|copy feedback| Human
Human -->|paste response| Agent

